    <pubDate>Thu, 10 Sep 2026 04:05:01 GMT</pubDate>
    <description>Manbalarga ko‘ra, Alibaba AI modellarni sinovdan o‘tkazuvchi UniPat AI startapiga 300 million dollar sarmoya kiritishga tayyorlanmoqda. Bu sarmoya bilan UniPat AI kompaniyasi 2.5 milliard dollarga baholanmoqda.</description>
